From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Rowley <johnrowleyster@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:09:30 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Direct3DRM mesh builder, animation set and user visual
 stubs to miniwin

Declare IDirect3DRMMeshBuilder, IDirect3DRMMeshBuilder2,
IDirect3DRMMeshBuilder3, IDirect3DRMAnimationSet2 and
IDirect3DRMUserVisual with their IIDs, the user-visual callback and
reason types, and IDirect3DRM3's CreateMeshBuilder, CreateAnimationSet
and CreateUserVisual.

miniwin has no object for these yet, so each gets a new stub class:
Direct3DRMMeshBuilderImpl answers all three mesh builder IIDs,
Direct3DRMAnimationSetImpl answers IID_IDirect3DRMAnimationSet2, and
Direct3DRMUserVisualImpl answers IID_IDirect3DRMUserVisual and keeps
its callback and argument. The IDirect3DRM3 Create methods return these
objects, and their methods log once and return E_NOTIMPL.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

